    "name": "Dreadshot",
    "steam_appid": 2782640,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782640/extras/d340d1cdc2582869ffdf82ea305e7966.avif?t=1743802237\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is currently under extremely active development by one person. The screenshots of the game do not reflect the style of the game, the final quality, and the final version of the game will be vastly different from most anything you can see right now. It's created for the most part for fans on my social networks who have long wanted to add my game to their wishlist, and thus follow the game's development. Thank you for your understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782640/extras/cdd9a6774b93b0b71857efe58287f5d6.avif?t=1743802237\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreadshot is a new-school fast-paced FPS, made by solo-gamedeveloper, that combines a lot of dynamic shooters like Doom Eternal, Titanfall, ULTRAKILL and is augmented with platforming elements from games like Ghostrunner and Katana Zero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782640/extras/de2594a590f060142c526b8b3d40f976.avif?t=1743802237\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delta Inc. is creating its own metaverse game, codename &quot;Project Elisium&quot;, which is designed to replace the oppressive reality of humanity with countless virtual worlds, and thus enslave the mind of all mankind for the sake of gaining computing power. You play as an assassin, a professional agent codenamed Dreadshot, and your goal is to prevent the company from releasing the game... Or to help?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782640/extras/a9fa93208d40bbeef78118a6e996cf93.avif?t=1743802237\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You're given a vast amount of options for movement, ranging from the usual sliding, to grapple-hooking, wall running, and other more complex mechanics that you, as the player, will learn as you progress through the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock a variety of unique abilities to divide by 0 kilobytes of tester avatars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There are 4 types of weapons in your arsenal: light, medium, heavy, and edged weapons, and only one weapon from a category can you use at a time. Combine different weapon options to specifically suit your play style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782640/extras/c136628c2256c758effd8b25ed61e8e2.avif?t=1743802237\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Create your own levels and share them with the community in Steam Workshop, creating endless options for digital ultraviolence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pass specially prepared levels for maximum speed, set new records and prove that speed is one of the most important characteristics for a mercenary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Test your stamina in loop testing mode, shredding virtual nerds into pixels</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782640/extras/d340d1cdc2582869ffdf82ea305e7966.avif?t=1743802237\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is currently under extremely active development by one person. The screenshots of the game do not reflect the style of the game, the final quality, and the final version of the game will be vastly different from most anything you can see right now. It's created for the most part for fans on my social networks who have long wanted to add my game to their wishlist, and thus follow the game's development. Thank you for your understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782640/extras/cdd9a6774b93b0b71857efe58287f5d6.avif?t=1743802237\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreadshot is a new-school fast-paced FPS, made by solo-gamedeveloper, that combines a lot of dynamic shooters like Doom Eternal, Titanfall, ULTRAKILL and is augmented with platforming elements from games like Ghostrunner and Katana Zero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782640/extras/de2594a590f060142c526b8b3d40f976.avif?t=1743802237\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delta Inc. is creating its own metaverse game, codename &quot;Project Elisium&quot;, which is designed to replace the oppressive reality of humanity with countless virtual worlds, and thus enslave the mind of all mankind for the sake of gaining computing power. You play as an assassin, a professional agent codenamed Dreadshot, and your goal is to prevent the company from releasing the game... Or to help?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782640/extras/a9fa93208d40bbeef78118a6e996cf93.avif?t=1743802237\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You're given a vast amount of options for movement, ranging from the usual sliding, to grapple-hooking, wall running, and other more complex mechanics that you, as the player, will learn as you progress through the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock a variety of unique abilities to divide by 0 kilobytes of tester avatars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There are 4 types of weapons in your arsenal: light, medium, heavy, and edged weapons, and only one weapon from a category can you use at a time. Combine different weapon options to specifically suit your play style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782640/extras/c136628c2256c758effd8b25ed61e8e2.avif?t=1743802237\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Create your own levels and share them with the community in Steam Workshop, creating endless options for digital ultraviolence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pass specially prepared levels for maximum speed, set new records and prove that speed is one of the most important characteristics for a mercenary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Test your stamina in loop testing mode, shredding virtual nerds into pixels</p>",
    "short_description": "Dreadshot is a fast and dynamic first-person shooter with parkour elements. The gameplay wants to combine all the best mechanics of modern shooters into a cohesive whole, \u0430nd the plot is a deep satire on the current state of the gaming industry.",
